## Survey Results

Live results for one survey. It queries the survey's realm for `SurveyResponse` cards linked to it (`survey.id`) and aggregates them per question: a tally with percentages for choice and yes/no questions, an average and distribution for ratings, and the written answers for text questions.

```ts
import SurveyResults from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/survey/components/survey-results';

<SurveyResults
  @surveyId={{@model.id}}
  @questions={{@model.questions}}
  @realms={{this.realms}}
  @context={{@context}}
/>
```

The query is live, so a response submitted elsewhere appears without a reload. Answers are matched to questions by prompt text, since each response keeps the prompts it was asked. Rewording a question therefore starts a fresh tally for it; earlier answers stay under the old wording. Multiple choice picks are counted against the question's own options, so an option containing a comma stays whole.

### Example

The linked Season Kickoff Fan Forum survey has one saved response; its Results view shows each aggregate.

### Non-goals

No cross-survey reporting, export or filtering by respondent; those are queries a consumer owns.
